OL,3,GNEWSATwo more arrests after man
OL,4,Acritically injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating an assault in
OL,7,FBradford that left a man with critical
OL,8,Finjuries have arrested two more men on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of attempted murder.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Brompton Road
OL,12,Fjust after 21:00 BST on Saturday to
OL,13,Freports a man had been injured with
OL,14,Fweapons during a fight in the street.
OL,16,FThe 59-year-old victim, who suffered a
OL,17,Fserious head injury, remains in
OL,18,Fhospital in a critical condition, West
OL,19,FYorkshire Police said.
